WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:04,210
What should you do if you encounter those monsters?

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:10,300
Keep your mouth shut, don't make any sound, hide in a corner, or under the table or bed

3
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:13,660
So what if, what if it is discovered?

4
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:20,990
Then just rub it on your neck, it's like getting an injection, it'll just hurt for a while

5
00:00:20,990 --> 00:00:23,990
If you are caught by a monster, it will be much more painful than an injection.

6
00:00:23,990 --> 00:00:28,530
Ping Ping is very smart, but Uncle Shi is too weak to protect you properly.

7
00:00:28,530 --> 00:00:31,530
Tell me well that you have been protecting Pingping, and Pingping knows it.
